diff --git a/src/pages/legal/privacy.astro b/src/pages/legal/privacy.astro
index 4477e28..50e036a 100644
--- a/src/pages/legal/privacy.astro
+++ b/src/pages/legal/privacy.astro
@@ -11,7 +11,35 @@ import LegalLayout from '../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
     <p>The operators of this website and its pages take the protection of your personal data very seriously. Hence, we handle your personal data as confidential information and in compliance with the statutory data protection regulations and this Data Protection Declaration.</p>
     <p>Whenever you use this website, a variety of personal information will be collected. Personal data comprises data that can be used to personally identify you. This Data Protection Declaration explains which data we collect as well as the purposes we use this data for. It also explains how, and for which purpose the information is collected.</p>
     
-    <h2>3. Recording of data on our website</h2>
-    <p><strong>Cookies</strong></p>
-    <p>In some instances, our website and its pages use so-called cookies. Cookies do not cause any damage to your computer and do not contain viruses. The purpose of cookies is to make our website more user friendly, effective and more secure. Cookies are small text files that are placed on your computer and stored by your browser.</p>
+    <h2>3. Privacy by Design &amp; Data Minimization</h2>
+    <p><strong>Minimal Data Collection</strong></p>
+    <p>We believe that "if you don't have the data, you can't lose it." We adhere strictly to data minimization and purpose limitation:</p>
+    <ul>
+        <li><strong>Account Registration &amp; Sign-In:</strong> We only collect a chosen username (pseudonym) and password. We do not require real names, email addresses, telephone numbers, birthdates, or billing details.</li>
+        <li><strong>Purpose Limitation:</strong> Your credentials are used exclusively to authenticate you and manage your reading list. They are never repurposed for marketing or sold to data brokers.</li>
+        <li><strong>Secure Credential Handling:</strong> Passwords are cryptographically hashed and never stored in plain text or in insecure browser storage mechanisms like <code>localStorage</code>.</li>
+    </ul>
+
+    <h2>4. Third-Party Scripts and Tracking Audit</h2>
+    <p><strong>Zero Covert Tracking</strong></p>
+    <p>We audit all third-party code integrated into our application:</p>
+    <ul>
+        <li><strong>No Covert Analytics:</strong> We do not load unconsented third-party behavioral scripts or click-tracking analytics in our page layout.</li>
+        <li><strong>No Third-Party Advertising Trackers:</strong> We do not embed behavioral advertising scripts or cross-site tracking pixels that follow you across the web.</li>
+    </ul>
+
+    <h2>5. Defensive Document and Security Headers</h2>
+    <p>We enforce strict browser-level security and privacy headers across all pages:</p>
+    <ul>
+        <li><strong>Referrer-Policy:</strong> Set to <code>strict-origin-when-cross-origin</code> to prevent leaking sensitive URLs and query parameters to external origins.</li>
+        <li><strong>Permissions-Policy:</strong> Disables access by default to device hardware features (camera, microphone, geolocation, sensors) and privacy-invasive ad-targeting APIs (<code>browsing-topics</code>, <code>run-ad-auction</code>, <code>join-ad-interest-group</code>).</li>
+        <li><strong>X-Content-Type-Options:</strong> Set to <code>nosniff</code> to prevent MIME type sniffing vulnerabilities.</li>
+        <li><strong>X-Frame-Options:</strong> Set to <code>SAMEORIGIN</code> to protect against clickjacking attacks.</li>
+    </ul>
+
+    <h2>6. Cookies and Browser Storage</h2>
+    <p>In some instances, our website and its pages use essential session cookies. Essential session cookies are strictly necessary to maintain your login session and reading list. We do not use third-party tracking cookies or store sensitive authentication tokens in unpartitioned or insecure client storage.</p>
+
+    <h2>7. User Rights and Data Control</h2>
+    <p>You have the right to request access to your stored account information, correct any inaccuracies, or request the complete erasure of your account and associated reading list at any time.</p>
 </LegalLayout>
